{
  "body": "\\section{A document label}\\label{_2294854b8764793573831ea16c22aaf972f0e76}\n\nA label reference Section~\\ref{_2294854b8764793573831ea16c22aaf972f0e76} and a bibliography citation \\autocite{doe2020}.\n\nNormal \\autocite{doe2020}.\n\nProse \\textcite{doe2020}.\n\nYear \\autocite*{doe2020} and the negative shorthand \\autocite*{doe2020}.\n\nAuthor \\citeauthor{lee2019}.\n\nFull \\fullcite{knuth1984}.\n\nHidden \\nocite{knuth1984} still lists the entry.\n\nA custom locator \\autocite[see][p.~12]{knuth1984}.\n\nA prefix starts a new subgroup \\autocites{doe2020}[see][]{lee2019}.\n\nA prefix before a shared subgroup \\autocites[see][]{doe2020}{lee2019}.\n\nBare citations merge across spaces: \\autocite{doe2020,lee2019}.\n\nBracketed citations also merge: \\autocite{doe2020,lee2019}.\n\nTwo label references Section~\\ref{_2294854b8764793573831ea16c22aaf972f0e76}, Section~\\ref{_2294854b8764793573831ea16c22aaf972f0e76}.\n\nA group mixing a label and a bibliography key {[}?sec-only; doe2020{]}.\n\nAn unknown bibliography key {[}?missing-key{]}.\n",
